	(text "J3: I2C cable to the separate IMU board (1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL - Qwiic pinout).\nThe IMU's own resistors and capacitors live on that board; bus pull-ups R7/R8 stay here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
